 "stem": "The ordered pair $({=t}, {=s})$ is a solution of the equation $kx - y = {=c}$. Find the value of $k$.",
 "answer": "a",
 "solution": [
  "Substitute $x = {=t}$ and $y = {=s}$ into the equation: ${=t}k - ({=s}) = {=c}$.",
  "So ${=t}k = {=c} + ({=s}) + 0 = {=a * t}$.",
  "Divide by ${=t}$: $k = {=a}$."
 ],
